GLM-5.3-Flash (arch glm5next) for the Galactus engine.

Source: ggml-org/llama.cpp PR #27754 (danielhanchen, the converter behind the
unsloth/GLM-5.3-Flash-GGUF files), head 86ebfef2c6, diffed from its merge base
930e2fa5, an ancestor of the pinned b1ff4ca2. Two hunks were rebased by hand:
graph_max_nodes (upstream had inserted HRM_TEXT next to KIMI_K3) and the
test-llama-archs hparams block. Applies after galactus-h4-llamacpp.diff.

The architecture: KDA linear attention on 34 of 45 layers, DeepSeek sparse
attention with a pooled (kpool=4) lightning indexer on the other 11, four
hyper-connection streams mixed by Sinkhorn, NoPE MLA, 288 routed experts
with a clamped SwiGLU, one MTP layer, and a vision tower in mtmd.

Remove this file and its line in appliquer.sh once upstream merges it.

